      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Decode arithmetic intensity is very low.  Attainable performance = min(peak compute, memory bandwidth × arithmetic intensity).\nIf weights cannot reach Tensor Cores fast enough, peak math stays idle: reduce bytes, increase reuse, batch, or speculate.",
