      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1790001000042,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Do not maximize a metric in isolation. Higher occupancy can lose if it causes spills; fewer kernels can lose if fusion increases register pressure.\nThe winning change improves the end-to-end workload under the same correctness and SLA constraints.",
      "originalText": "Do not maximize a metric in isolation. Higher occupancy can lose if it causes spills; fewer kernels can lose if fusion increases register pressure.\nThe winning change improves the end-to-end workload under the same correctness and SLA constraints.",
